{"chapter-slug":"rw6-00","paragraph":49,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Alber, the [Fist Fighter].","id":"3e0de15e-4659-53da-94d5-d2e9bf083263"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-00","paragraph":50,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"He was a [Fist Fighter] and earned his coin challenging visitors and the citizens of Reizmelt to fights.","id":"86dda2d4-8d2e-5594-9896-9c28bc28e130"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-00","paragraph":65,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"And yet, he was a [Fist Fighter]. Not the first this world had ever seen, but unique to Reizmelt.","id":"5a1d9fb6-bf4d-5b77-8fb4-08a39264af6b"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-00","paragraph":330,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"No, it was Alber that Ryoka was interested in.","id":"71d147c7-2235-530e-b272-3a93519972eb"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-25","paragraph":24,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"The [Fist Fighter] was a young man. His name was Alber, and that was more information than most people needed to know about him.","id":"2a9f465c-4b15-5301-9cb2-086f02c3a176"}
