{"chapter-slug":"rw6-25","paragraph":55,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"The [Fist Fighter] was a young man. His name was Alber, and that was more information than most people needed to know about him.","id":"5d1d1237-265f-5ded-907f-6ce8f4ecbec7"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-25","paragraph":66,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Alber had seen bar fights, tavern brawls, and participated in a few himself","id":"5eae74bf-4d7f-54fe-8697-180310ef08a7"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-25","paragraph":77,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"And that was all Alber thought on his day.","id":"95068814-48ec-5583-ba69-cca411ed959c"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-37 E","paragraph":389,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-quote":"She strolled off past Geram. The [Fist Fighter] hesitated and walked over to Rie.","id":"4067a8c8-610e-58ea-aac0-9312ec6e4deb"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-37 E","paragraph":451,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The [Fist Fighter] looked back down the street. Rie shook her head.","id":"90820875-482c-59c8-80e9-0ab01c25b543"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw6-41 E","paragraph":1411,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"madain","holder-quote":"Alber looked up from his cold meal. He thought about it, then got up.","id":"d5a95999-2295-56b7-b8c6-f091d1b6a374"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":334,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"But Alber took him apart in the little ring. He ducked, weaving, blocking some punches, letting the other fighter tire himself out. What was it called?","id":"9f9cc856-5148-5d23-9d08-2a9097f1a484"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":336,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Moreover, Fierre watched with open mouth as Alber’s seventh opponent went down and no one stepped up to challenge him. She reached for her notes and wrote something down slowly.","id":"6d4723cf-ede2-502b-bf21-5ce49ec97434"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":369,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"garia-strongheart","holder-quote":"It went to winning thanks from both. Garia was shamefaced—and so was Alber, for underestimating his opponent.","id":"db266494-90cf-5361-b05c-cd4fbe18a845"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-13 F","paragraph":805,"wording":"[Fist Fighter]","event":"named","holder-slug":"alber","holder-quote":"Not even little Mrsha, who understood the danger, perhaps better than Alber.","id":"89348ba9-5d9a-5821-9448-516aadc1f6a1"}
